negligentia.</HI></P> <P COM="0477">Quae fides exigit.] Articulos fidei,  <HI REND="ITALIC">inquit margo. C.</HI></P> <P COM="0477">Deberet exspectare.]  <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Sapere.  <HI REND="ITALIC">V. omittit.</HI></P> <P COM="0477">Gastrimargiam.]  <HI REND="ITALIC">Tria</HI>  Castrimargiam.</P> <P COM="0477">Occasionem rapiendi.]  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ait C. in ora superiori.</HI> 
